Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.59,0:20:27.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnYusei Magic}君たちは　私の本当の→\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你们其实是我真正的{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
